          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="service">
          <div class="service-number">04 / FULL PROJECT</div>
          <h3>Qo‘shiq “pod klyuch”</h3>
          <p>
            G‘oyadan tayyor relizgacha bo‘lgan musiqiy loyihani
            bir joyda tashkil qilish.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- ABOUT -->
    <section id="about">

      <div class="about">

        <div class="section-title">
          <small>About us</small>
          <h2>Leyli Media</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="gold-line"></div>

        <p class="about-text">
          Biz musiqa va ijodkorlikni qadrlaymiz.
          Leyli Media — xonandalar, musiqachilar va ijodkorlar
          o‘z g‘oyalarini professional ovozga aylantirishi uchun
          yaratilgan studiya.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- CONTACT -->
    <section id="contact">

      <div class="contact">

        <div class="section-title">
          <small>Contact</small>
          <h2>Loyihangizni boshlaymizmi?</h2>
          <p>
            Studiya haqida ma’lumot olish yoki yozuv uchun
            bog‘laning.
          </p>
        </div>

        <a href="tel:+998996676688" class="phone">
          +998 99 667 66 88
        </a>

        <p class="contact-note">
          Qo‘ng‘iroq qilish uchun raqam ustiga bosing
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>

  </main>


  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer>

    <img src="logo.png" alt="Leyli Media" class="footer-logo">

    <div class="footer-name">
      Leyli Media
    </div>

    <p>
      Professional ovoz yozish studiyasi
    </p>

    <br>

    <p>
      © 2026 Leyli Media. Barcha huquqlar himoyalangan.
    </p>

  </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
